# SQLite persistence

- Database lives under `DATA_DIR/db/safedevops.db` (or `DATABASE_URL`)
- Local default `DATA_DIR=./data`; deployed default `DATA_DIR=/data`
- Never commit DB files or bake them into images
- Enforce one application replica and one Uvicorn worker while SQLite is used
- Create parent directories on startup; run migrations before serving traffic
- Never return absolute filesystem paths through APIs
- See `docs/decisions/ADR-002-sqlite-persistent-storage.md`
